DE:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh, du bist wieder da, sehr gut!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Und wie ich sehe, hast du auch
jemanden mitgebracht.{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh, gut. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ich hatte mir schon
gedacht, dass auf dich Verlass ist
und du bald zurück sein würdest.{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Whew!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} When you didn't come back,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
I thought something bad might have
happened.{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh, finalmente!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Pensavo fosse
successo qualcosa di grave,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
dato che non ti vedevo tornare.{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Huiuiui! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Als du so lange nicht
gekommen bist, dachte ich schon,
es wäre vielleicht etwas passiert!{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}On se calme, je suis là. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Quel que
soit le problème, tu as fait appel à
la bonne personne pour le résoudre.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Hum... Je voulais juste te rendre un
truc qui t'appartient. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Je me suis
dit que tu en avais peut-être besoin.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Dunque, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}volevo soltanto restituirti
quello che mi avevi prestato.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Mi sembrava di ricordare che
tu ne avessi urgente bisogno{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
O ricordo male?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Right!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} I do need that back.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} It's
totally an important part of one of
my craft projects.
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}By the way,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I hope the smell of my
cologne on this wasn't distracting.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I know it's hard to ignore.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}¡Ay,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} sí!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Tienes toda la razón.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} 
Sin esto me sería imposible concluir
uno de mis muchos proyectos.
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Por cierto,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} espero que el perfume
que envuelve todos mis objetos no
te despistara.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Se han dado casos.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh, bien vu !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} En effet, impossible de
mettre la touche finale à mon
dernier projet top-secret sans ça !
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Hmm, je sens que c'est encore
imprégné de mon parfum suave...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Tu en as profité gratis, veinarde !{{TAG:0003:0000:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Aa!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Doğru!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} Buna gerçekten ihtiyacım var.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
El işi projelerimden birinin çok önemli
bir parçası.
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Bu arada,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} üstündeki parfüm kokum dikkatini
dağıtmamıştır umarım.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Görmezden gelmesi
zor, biliyorum.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Ya ha llegado lo que pedimos
por catálogo! {{TAG:0007:0001:}}Quería darte lo
tuyo cuanto antes,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Unsere Bestellung ist angekommen!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich wollte dir deinen Teil natürlich
sofort überreichen, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Gestern war ein Brief in meinem
Briefkasten, aber es stand
überhaupt kein Absender drauf!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Die Schrift sah allerdings verdächtig
nach deiner aus, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Hast du ihn mir geschickt?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}¡Me has descubierto!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Reconocer la
letra de la gente es todo un talento,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
casi como leer los labios.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Te estaba poniendo a prueba.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Enhorabuena,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} la has pasado!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Por cierto{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} la carta iba en serio.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Creo que si llevara un buen bigote
estaría arrebatador.

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Claro che sí! Te l'ho spedita io!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Riesci perfino a riconoscere la mia
scrittura?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Sei davvero talentosa!
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Ah,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} stavo quasi per dimenticarmene!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Il contenuto di quella lettera sarà
il nostro pequeño segreto.{{TAG:0003:0026:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I was just wondering if you got the
instructions for making homemade
pasta.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I sent them a few days ago.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Je me demandais juste si tu avais
bien reçu la recette de pâtes que
je t'ai envoyée l'autre jour...{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Qualche giorno fa ti ho spedito
la ricetta per i ravioli fatti in casa.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Volevo sapere se l'avevi ricevuta.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ich wollte mich bloß mal erkundigen,
ob mein Rezept für selbst gemachte
Nudeln bei dir angekommen ist...{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} claro che sí!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} Muchas gracias!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}L'ho provata subito e mi sono
venuti benissimo!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Per ringraziarti a dovere, cucinerò
un piattone di ravioli alla {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}
soltanto per te!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Li condirò con il mio sugo speciale.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Dopo che li avrai assaggiati,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
non potrai più farne a meno!

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0003:}}Well, {{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I think that wraps
up our conversation.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} if you'll excuse me. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I look forward to our next meeting!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0003:}}Pekâlâ, {{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} sanırım konuşmamız
burada tamamlandı.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0000}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} müsaadenle. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bir sonraki görüşmemizi sabırsızlıkla bekliyorum!
